Spring Boot : 
--> Spring Boot is a framework built on top of Spring that makes it easy and fast to create Java applications.
--> It removes most of the configuration work required in Spring and allows developers to build applications quickly.
In Simple Words :
Spring Framework = Powerful but requires more setup.
Spring Boot = Spring Framework + Auto Configuration + Embedded Server + Faster Development.
